This product bundles the following third-party software in its shaded JAR.
biscuit-java itself (org.biscuitsec.*, biscuit.format.schema) is not
relocated; its dependencies are relocated under
fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.*:

  - biscuit-java 4.0.1 (org.biscuitsec:biscuit)             — Apache-2.0
  - Protocol Buffers 3.25.5 (com.google.protobuf:protobuf-java)
      -> fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.protobuf             — BSD-3-Clause
  - Gson 2.8.9 (com.google.code.gson:gson)
      -> fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.gson                 — Apache-2.0
  - RE2/J 1.6 (com.google.re2j:re2j)
      -> fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.re2j                 — BSD-3-Clause
  - Vavr 0.10.3 (io.vavr:vavr)
      -> fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.vavr                 — Apache-2.0
  - Vavr Match 0.10.3 (io.vavr:vavr-match)
      -> fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.vavr.match           — Apache-2.0
  - EdDSA-Java 0.3.0 (net.i2p.crypto:eddsa)
      -> fr.vado.keycloak.biscuit.shaded.i2pcrypto            — CC0-1.0

The BSD-3-Clause license texts of Protocol Buffers and RE2/J are included in
the JAR under META-INF/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES/.

The following dependencies are provided by the Keycloak runtime and are NOT
bundled (scope=provided): org.keycloak:*, jakarta.ws.rs:jakarta.ws.rs-api.

Test-only dependencies (scope=test, not distributed): JUnit, Mockito,
Jackson, Testcontainers.
